3D preview
----------

The 3D renderer includes a standalone Newstroke decoder and text layout module
in src/web/strokeText.ts, adapted from KiCanvas's MIT-licensed font implementation.
See media/3d/LICENSE.kicanvas for its copyright and permission notice.
The original glyph data is preserved in src/web/fonts/newstrokeData.ts, with
its source bundle hash recorded there. No KiCanvas bundle is read or loaded
by the 3D build or renderer. See media/3d/LICENSE.newstroke for upstream font
attribution and license notices, including the CJK glyph terms.

